WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.010
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.790
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:18.220
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.400
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.450
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.880
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.440
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:45.630
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:49.390
...inside my heart.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.620
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:59.910
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.580
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:12.250
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:17.760
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:21.930
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:28.120
...a future that has no end.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:37.100
The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow
that the Believing Heart Opens!

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.870
Flame Arrow!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.060
My heart...

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:42.010
The shadow of my heart that
I left here in that one instant...

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.740
I was all alone...

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.680
I searched everywhere,
but you weren't there...

00:02:56.220 --> 00:03:02.560
I was crying all alone when Mother
Debonair said she'd stay with me...

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.360
That she'd love me...

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:08.830
I'm sorry.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.730
You were lonely all by yourself...

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.330
Yes...

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.440
Nova...

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.880
Can you feel my heart?

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.080
I want to be happy
together with the people I love.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.220
I want to live and be happy.

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:33.690
Nova, I think I want to love myself.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.630
I want to love myself...

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:40.220
...even the parts that
feel regret, pain, and sadness.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.200
Will you love me too?

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.530
Come back...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.050
Nova...

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.560
Please tell me where Debonair is.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.650
Tell me, Alcyone!

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.380
At this rate, he'll...

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.940
He'll die!

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.520
You're not Presea, are you?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.890
Y-You read my mind, didn't you...

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:51.440
I remember hearing from Presea
that she had a younger twin sister.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.660
That's right.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.740
I'm Sierra, Presea's younger sister.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.010
Why are you
pretending to be Presea?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.710
Because I didn't want
to sadden the Magic Knights.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.790
And because I wanted to help him.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.420
You're... With Master Mage Clef...

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:19.520
Losing my identity as Sierra
is nothing if it's for Clef.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.500
If it means I can be at his side...

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.470
Even if you know it's of no use?

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.340
Even if it's no use...

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.910
For the sake of the one you love...

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.380
Tell us, Alcyone.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:42.150
Where is Debonair?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.630
I don't want any more people to die!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:50.720
That's why
we're going to fight Debonair.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.500
Even if you can't win?

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.270
We will win.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.200
We'll make sure we win
to protect the people we love.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.770
Please tell us, Ms. Alcyone.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.840
Even if it's no use...

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.750
For the sake of the ones you love...

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.950
Lady Debonair is...

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.910
Ms. Alcyone!
Alcyone! Alcyone!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:37.370
Debonair is...

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:42.240
Could this be because she's
trying to talk about Debonair?

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.550
Stop! You don't have to tell us!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.140
Stop! You don't have to tell us!
Ms. Alcyone!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.420
Debonair is...

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.130
...in Cephiro's underside!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.000
Alcyone!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.900
This end was my decision.

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:16.280
There's no need to cry.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.520
Lord Zagato...

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.300
Alcyone...

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.990
Magic Knights,
please make sure to return.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.610
The underside of Cephiro
Alcyone was talking about...

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:25.810
I am sure that
it is beyond that darkness.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.180
Let's go, Umi, Fuu.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.680
Flame Arrow!

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:36.420
Water Dragon!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.300
Emerald Typhoon!

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:51.770
Now!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:08.550
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:14.560
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.930
So Debonair is there?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.220
Regalia?

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.630
I am impressed you've
come this far, Magic Knights.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:50.930
Debonair!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.740
But this is the end.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:14.830
Look out!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:16.860
Let us hurry outside!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:29.000
Foolish little bugs.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:34.870
Better to patiently await
eradication than meekly fight back.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:40.780
I will not let you rest
in peace, Magic Knights.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:53.730
Ice Blade!

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:58.630
Emerald Cyclone!

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.000
Umi! Fuu!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.950
Protecting Cephiro
was Eagle's last wish.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.680
You're in the way!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:25.850
Shield!

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.690
Geo! Zazu!

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:36.700
Ms. Aska!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.200
Tarta! Tatra!

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.800
Do your best, Magic Knights!

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:44.810
You won against me!
What will you do if you lose here?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.970
You should be stronger than this!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.050
Noisy little flies.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.210
Stop it!

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:58.490
Spiral Flash!

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.990
Damn you...

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.860
Damn you.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.510
Lantis's pendant...
It saved me again?

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.650
You will pay.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:33.660
You will pay, Magic Knights!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.360
Hikaru!

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.790
Umi!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:42.870
Fuu!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.360
She's strong...

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.130
Why is she...

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.410
...so strong?

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:58.210
It is because I was
created by Cephiro's people.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:05.150
Cephiro's people, who believed in
and entrusted everything to the Pillar.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:12.090
The vast amount of fear
from losing that Pillar created me.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:25.540
Everyone! Don't even
think about being scared!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.010
When the monsters appeared
last time, we beat them...

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:38.050
...by believing the Magic
Knights would definitely win!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.920
Yeah, believe!

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.590
Don't think about being scared!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:46.760
That's right!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.230
Monsters in Cephiro are
created by people's hearts.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.830
The fearful heart then
makes the enemies stronger!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:15:00.640
Then that Debonair
is from our hearts?

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:07.080
Our fear puts
the Magic Knights in greater danger.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.190
Do not fear!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.020
Fight against your heart that fears!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:15.950
Jeez! You guys are irritating!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.160
Who does this country
of Cephiro belong to?

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.830
Cephiro is our country!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.370
Our country that
we should defend ourselves.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.800
A precious place
where all our loved ones live!

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:33.540
If we don't protect those
we love with our own hands...

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:37.670
Believe in yourselves!
No one other than yourselves!

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.120
Fight with us!

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.250
I'll believe!

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.980
I'll believe too.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.090
Me too!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.990
Me too!
I'll believe as well!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.930
Do your best, misses!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.960
We'll fight with you!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.810
Rayearth's power is...

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.470
Everyone's hearts are pouring in...

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.780
The hearts of Cephiro's people!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.250
The proof of the Pillar...

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.320
The heart that believes in oneself...

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:02.500
Damn you, people of Cephiro!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:06.000
Damn you, Magic Knights...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.530
So the Pillar was Hikaru after all...

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:30.560
Hikaru, that proof of the Pillar...

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.870
I promised Clef.

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:37.200
That if I was qualified
to become the Pillar...

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:40.970
...I would wish for
Cephiro to be the way I want.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:44.900
Yes.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:51.210
I rid Cephiro of the Pillar!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:54.340
And from now on, I want Cephiro...

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:58.220
...to be created by all
those who love this country!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.900
Thy wish has been granted.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:58.080
Thy wish to visit Cephiro once
again and fight for thine hearts...

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.810
...has been granted.

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:04.580
Then the ones who
summoned us to Cephiro...

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.990
...were thyselves.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:09.060
Then we...

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.960
...must return home now.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.000
Umi.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.540
Clef... Clef, I...

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:26.400
Never mind.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.340
Thank you, Umi.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.080
Fuu.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:32.610
Ferio...

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:35.690
You returned, just as you promised.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:39.850
I will not forget.
I will never forget you.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.320
Fuu...

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:43.820
Hikaru.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.020
Lantis...

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:51.000
I'm sure Cephiro will be a beautiful
and peaceful country from now on.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:54.500
Rivaling when Princess
Emeraude was around.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.570
Yes.

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.270
Lantis...

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.310
I love you.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.310
And I you.

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.470
We're back.

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:37.480
It was our will that
allowed us to return to Cephiro.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:42.850
And this time, we were able
to fight so that we had no regrets.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.190
It has been over
a year now since that time.

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:22.430
We were junior-high-school girls
who went to another world twice.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.090
Look!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.410
So beautiful...

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:45.380
They were able to create a beautiful,
peaceful world even without a Pillar.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:49.510
With everyone pooling
their strength together, right?

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.920
I want to go
to Cephiro one more time.

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:55.960
But this time, it's not out of regret.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:06.740
It's to learn the story
of the new Cephiro.

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:27.750
Fin

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:35.990
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:45.510
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:53.680
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:55.050 --> 00:23:00.150
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:08.230
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:14.970
...keep welling up.

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:23.010
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:29.720
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:39.020
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:48.330
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:04.790
Who is it today?

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:07.760
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:12.490
Everyone, thanks so much
for watching for so long!
